	<TextRow
		Label="pw_briefing_001"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Ctrl1:xcenter ]まほうクイーンと　なのる　おんな
[Ctrl1:xcenter ]ジュジュベに　よって
[Ctrl1:xcenter ]まほうのオリに　とじこめられた
[Ctrl1:xcenter ][Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]おうじ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-11-17T12:17:30" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Ctrl1:xcenter ]まほうクイーンと　名乗る　女
[Ctrl1:xcenter ]ジュジュベに　よって
[Ctrl1:xcenter ]魔法のオリに　閉じ込められた
[Ctrl1:xcenter ][Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]王子</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-11-17T12:17:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>あらすじ♂</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-08-02T11:01:23" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
